---
description: Source records and citation syntax
globs: content/sources/**,content/**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `docs/SOURCES.md`.

- Add a YAML record in `content/sources/` before citing a work.
- Cite with `[src:gg:source:…]`.
- Never fabricate a URL to complete a record.
- External link checks are `npm run verify:links` only.
